      "status": "PRESENT",
      "chunk_id": "text_3",
      "quote": "The search began with the formulation of the following research question by R.S.C., whose clinical response was possible, in PIO (Population-Intervention-Outcome) format [46]: 'Has the possible exposure to SARS-CoV-2 during the COVID-19 pandemic (I) affected the mental health (O) of HPs providing health care outside the hospital (P)?",
      "reason": "The review explicitly states the research question using the PIO (Population-Intervention-Outcome) framework."
    },
    {
      "element_id": "prisma_2020_4_e2",
      "status": "NOT_APPLICABLE",
      "chunk_id": null,
      "quote": null,
      "reason": "This is a systematic review of the psychological impact of a pandemic (observational/exposure study), not a review of intervention effects; therefore, the requirement to state planned comparisons for intervention effects does not apply."
    }
  ],
  "confidence": 100
